# Dedicated ignore-file for ops/docker/Dockerfile.frontend.
#
# BuildKit prefers "<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore" over the repo-root ".dockerignore".
# So this file FULLY REPLACES the root .dockerignore for the frontend build — the root
# one (which strips packages/frontend for the M1 st-bundle image) is intentionally NOT
# consulted here. Patterns below are relative to the build context root.

# Host-installed deps / build caches — always re-installed/rebuilt inside the image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo

# VCS / editor / logs / secrets.
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
*.log
# Exclude ALL .env files at any depth (e.g. packages/frontend/.env.local), which would
# otherwise leak dev-only NEXT_PUBLIC_* / ST_LOCAL_URL into the prod build and override
# the NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL build arg. NEXT_PUBLIC_* are supplied via the build arg only.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# The frontend image only needs packages/frontend + its workspace deps
# (@miniapp/shared, @miniapp/bridge-protocol).
packages/backend
packages/sync-engine
packages/st-extension
packages/db-types

# Everything else is irrelevant to building + running the frontend.
vendor
docs
ops
scripts
platform-assets
Database
*.md
tmp-*
